{
  "case_goal": "Add a user twice to verify that the second addition fails due to duplicate username.",
  "summary": "Logs in as admin, navigates to Create user page, fills in user details (lastname: Smith, firstname: Bert, username: UserU, password: passwordU), submits the form, then repeats the entire process to attempt adding the same user again, expecting a failure message.",
  "steps": [
